---
import CTAButton from '../ui/CTAButton.astro';

const affiliateLink = 'https://refpa94475.com/L?tag=d_3955870m_98c_';
---

<section
  class="relative overflow-hidden min-h-[85vh] flex items-center"
  style="clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 88%, 0 100%);"
>
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-dark-800 via-dark-950 to-dark-900"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 opacity-40"
    style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 70% 20%, rgba(239,68,68,0.35), transparent 55%);"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>
  <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 lg:py-28 w-full">
    <div class="max-w-4xl">
      <p
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary-500/15 border border-primary-500/30 text-primary-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-6"
      >
        Казахстан · KZT · Live
      </p>
      <h1
        class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl xl:text-7xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.05] mb-6"
      >
        Ставки без лишних слов.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-300 max-w-xl mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        Линия, live и коэфициенты на экране — без воды. Нажми, пополни, играй; старт за пару минут.
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm max-w-lg mb-10">
        Мы показываем, куда нажать. Официальные правила всегда на стороне оператора.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 mb-14">
        <CTAButton href={affiliateLink} size="lg" external>Сделать ставку</CTAButton>
        <CTAButton href="/sozdat-akkaunt" variant="secondary" size="lg">Создать аккаунт</CTAButton>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 max-w-lg">
        <div>
          <p class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-primary-500">50+</p>
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 mt-1">виды спорта.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-primary-500">24/7</p>
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 mt-1">live-линия.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-primary-500">1 тап</p>
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 mt-1">до купона.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
